  "prefLabel": "Lot 215.03 Mandatory Pre-Hearing Disclosure of Witnesses and Exhibits",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 215.03 Mandatory Pre-Hearing Disclosure of Witnesses and Exhibits. At least 5 days before the hearing the parties shall exchange a list of all witnesses to be called at the hearing with a brief summary of their testimony, a list of all documents or exhibits to be offered as evidence at the hearing, and a copy of each document or exhibit.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Lot 200) #12093, eff 1-27-17 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Lot 200)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lot200.html"
